# ${project_name}

${project_description}

Packer templates for VM images and shared container images used across
the homelab.

## Layout

```
packer/<image>/
  *.pkr.hcl               # Packer config
  scripts/                # provisioning scripts
  http/                   # PXE / cloud-init data (where applicable)
```

## Workflow

```
just packer <target>      # build via justfile wrapper
```

Per-app container images live with their source repos. This repo is
for **shared** image builds (Packer VM templates, base images).

